  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT AIMS AT THE RECONSTRUCTION AND REHABILITATION OF THE ROAD SECTION DJOUK_KIFFA OF THE EXISTING AMAL ROAD. THIS WILL BE ACHIEVED THROUGH THE RECONSTRUCTION OF THE BASE COURSE, PAVEMENT AND SHOULDERS, DRAINAGE WORK AND CLEARANCE OF SECTIONS COVERED WITH SAND.</narrative>
